  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black'>570</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=57 style='width:42.5pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:
  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;
  height:30.85pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;
  text-align:center;line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
  font-family:"Times New Roman",serif;color:black'>319</span></p>
  </td>
  <td width=54 style='width:40.3pt;border-top:none;border-left:none;border-bottom:
  solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;
